@archive 0059
@size 3

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"노이즈의 벽이야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"지나갈 수가 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이 너머에\n다이고가 있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 네 아빠가\n도와줄 때가 된 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"무슨 말이야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"엄마가 준\n“다이고 키”를 선택해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"방금 머릿속에\n이 근처의 지점 몇 군데가 보였어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그게 아빠가\n도와준다는 뜻이야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"맞아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네가 방금 사용한 키가\n아빠와 공명한 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네가 본 곳 주변에\n네 아빠의 “기억 조각”이\n있을 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"“기억 조각”…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"메테오 G의 중심핵과\n너무 가까이 접촉한 탓에"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"다이고의 기억이\n흩어지기 시작했어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"전부 모으면\n아빠의 특별한 기억을\n되살릴 수 있을지도 몰라."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 기억이 에너지로 변해서\n우리 대신 그 벽을\n무너뜨려 줄 거야!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"좋아!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"“다이고 키”를 사용해서\n아빠의 기억을\n되살리자!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"“기억 조각”은\n눈으로 볼 수 없어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"“다이고 키”를 사용해야만\n몇 개가 있는지"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 어디에 있는지\n알 수 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"집중해야 해, 꼬맹이!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
